{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09600","headline":"送李翥游江外 · 岑参","name":"送李翥游江外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相识应十载，见君只一官。\n家贫禄尚薄，霜降衣仍单。\n惆怅秋草死，萧条芳岁阑。\n且寻沧洲路，遥指吴云端。\n匹马关塞远，孤舟江海宽。\n夜眠楚烟湿，晓饭湖山寒。\n砧净红鱠落，袖香朱橘团。\n帆前见禹庙，枕底闻严滩。\n便获赏心趣，岂歌行路难。\n青门须醉别，少爲解征鞍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09600.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09600","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}